   "id": "2115974470204596328",
   "text": "I love buddies interpersonal angst so much because it\u2019s so reflective of their relationship not being platonic but I yearn for the day that they\u2019re going through something together and fight something on the same side",
   "url": "https://x.com/uhbucky/status/2115974470204596328",
   "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:10:01+00:00",
